---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="J 的世界 Research｜Facts First · Evidence-Based Research">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">J 的世界 Research · 2026</div>
        <h1>把複雜產業，<br/><span>拆成看得懂的證據。</span></h1>
        <p>以公開資訊、技術脈絡與產業鏈交叉驗證，追蹤 AI、半導體、先進封裝、光通訊與能源等關鍵產業。</p>
      </div>
      <a class="hero-card" href="/research">
        <div class="kicker">Featured Research · Vol.01</div>
        <h2>AI Platform Evolution</h2>
        <p>從台積電技術論壇的關鍵訊號出發，追蹤下一代 AI 平台如何由晶片、封裝、光通訊、材料與電力共同演進。</p>
        <span class="button">閱讀研究 →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Latest Research</div><h2>最新研究</h2></div><p>Facts First · Evidence-Based Research</p></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card"><span class="tag">AI PLATFORM</span><h3>AI Platform Evolution：四個訊號如何共同打造下一代 AI 平台？</h3><p>從技術論壇訊號延伸至先進封裝、光通訊、材料與電力。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="tag">GLASS CORE</span><h3>Glass Core：為什麼玻璃開始成為高階封裝的重要答案？</h3><p>從需求變化回推材料、TGV 與封裝架構的產業鏈。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="tag">CPO</span><h3>CPO 商業化：光與電的邊界正在改變</h3><p>拆解 CPO、交換器、光引擎與台灣供應鏈的關係。</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Industry Maps</div><h2>產業地圖</h2></div><p>從技術節點找到產業受惠位置</p></div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="map-card"><div class="number">MAP 01</div><h3>AI 全產業鏈</h3><p>AI Chip → Advanced Packaging → Optical → Server → Power → Cooling</p></div>
        <div class="map-card"><div class="number">MAP 02</div><h3>Glass Core Ecosystem</h3><p>Glass → TGV → Core Substrate → Advanced Packaging → AI Accelerator</p></div>
        <div class="map-card"><div class="number">MAP 03</div><h3>CPO Ecosystem</h3><p>Switch → Optical Engine → Fiber → Packaging → Thermal → Power</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Poster Gallery</div><h2>研究海報</h2></div><a href="/posters" class="button">查看全部 →</a></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="poster-placeholder">POSTER / AI PLATFORM</div>
      <div class="poster-placeholder">POSTER / GLASS CORE</div>
      <div class="poster-placeholder">POSTER / CPO</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <div><div class="kicker">J Insight</div><h2>從公開資訊，找到下一個值得追蹤的訊號。</h2><p>市場推論會與已驗證事實明確區隔。</p></div>
      <a class="button" href="/about">了解研究方法 →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>